{"3251300": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Jonah Lomu Rugby Challenge 4", "steam_appid": 3251300, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>READY FOR THE CROSS-KICK?</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Outsmart your rivals with 10 dynamic set-play options, including the game-changing Cross-Kick!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take the field with 16 international Men’s and Women’s Sevens teams.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Create your ultimate rugby star with the enhanced Player Creator and custom Kit Creator, including advanced hairstyles, eye colour controls and deeper appearance editing.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >AI formations, improved positioning and realistic formations deliver tougher, more authentic rugby action.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience the game from broadcast-style camera angles, including side-line and drop-goal views.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Compete in over 12 competitions or create your own rugby legacy.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>RE-RELEASED &amp; REMASTERED FOR A NEW GENERATION</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >One of rugby gaming’s greatest experiences is back! Re-released and remastered in tribute to the legendary <strong>Jonah Lomu</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enhanced in stunning <strong>4K </strong>with massively upgraded visuals, improved lighting and smooth 60 FPS gameplay on modern hardware. <i>Jonah Lomu</i> <i>Rugby Challenge 4 Remastered</i> brings the thrills, spills and intensity of rugby to a new generation. No licensed teams, just fast, hard-hitting rugby and pure sporting fun.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>REALISTIC PLAYERS &amp; PRESENTATION</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Improved player models, dynamic mud and sweat effects, realistic hair physics, upgraded animations, and refreshed broadcast-style presentation bring every match to life.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>UPDATED STADIUMS &amp; ENVIRONMENTS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience richer stadium atmospheres with enhanced grass, detailed environments, realistic wear and tear, field damage, and modern visual effects.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>CROSS-PLATFORM FANHUB</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Share, download and rate players, teams and creations across all platforms through the famous FanHub community.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>THE DEFINITIVE RUGBY EXPERIENCE</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Jump into Single Match, Multi-Team Competition, Be A Pro, extensive multi-year Career Mode, and Online Multiplayer for up to 8 players.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>Note:</u> Save data and FanHub creations from the legacy version of Jonah Lomu Rugby Challenge 4 are not compatible with the Remastered version.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can still access all your previous data by switching and playing on the legacy branch:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Select game in Steam Library</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Open 'Manage' (gear icon) &gt; 'Properties...' &gt; 'Game Versions &amp; Betas'</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Then select the 'legacy' branch to switch</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can switch back to the Remastered branch at any time.</p>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>READY FOR THE CROSS-KICK?</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Outsmart your rivals with 10 dynamic set-play options, including the game-changing Cross-Kick!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take the field with 16 international Men’s and Women’s Sevens teams.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Create your ultimate rugby star with the enhanced Player Creator and custom Kit Creator, including advanced hairstyles, eye colour controls and deeper appearance editing.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >AI formations, improved positioning and realistic formations deliver tougher, more authentic rugby action.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience the game from broadcast-style camera angles, including side-line and drop-goal views.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Compete in over 12 competitions or create your own rugby legacy.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>RE-RELEASED &amp; REMASTERED FOR A NEW GENERATION</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >One of rugby gaming’s greatest experiences is back! Re-released and remastered in tribute to the legendary <strong>Jonah Lomu</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enhanced in stunning <strong>4K </strong>with massively upgraded visuals, improved lighting and smooth 60 FPS gameplay on modern hardware. <i>Jonah Lomu</i> <i>Rugby Challenge 4 Remastered</i> brings the thrills, spills and intensity of rugby to a new generation. No licensed teams, just fast, hard-hitting rugby and pure sporting fun.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>REALISTIC PLAYERS &amp; PRESENTATION</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Improved player models, dynamic mud and sweat effects, realistic hair physics, upgraded animations, and refreshed broadcast-style presentation bring every match to life.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>UPDATED STADIUMS &amp; ENVIRONMENTS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience richer stadium atmospheres with enhanced grass, detailed environments, realistic wear and tear, field damage, and modern visual effects.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>CROSS-PLATFORM FANHUB</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Share, download and rate players, teams and creations across all platforms through the famous FanHub community.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>THE DEFINITIVE RUGBY EXPERIENCE</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Jump into Single Match, Multi-Team Competition, Be A Pro, extensive multi-year Career Mode, and Online Multiplayer for up to 8 players.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>Note:</u> Save data and FanHub creations from the legacy version of Jonah Lomu Rugby Challenge 4 are not compatible with the Remastered version.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can still access all your previous data by switching and playing on the legacy branch:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Select game in Steam Library</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Open 'Manage' (gear icon) &gt; 'Properties...' &gt; 'Game Versions &amp; Betas'</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Then select the 'legacy' branch to switch</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can switch back to the Remastered branch at any time.</p>", "short_description": "GET INTO THE NEW CHALLENGE! Arguably the best rugby computer game, now re-released and remastered as a tribute to the great legend of Jonah Lomu.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong>, French<strong>*</strong>, Italian, Spanish - Spain<br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3251300/b735eee580c30a227268d223a847f780183ba522/header.jpg?t=1782353718", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3251300/4b577e0285adc36c6cb48b7267eb0352ccc542a2/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1782353718", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3251300/4b577e0285adc36c6cb48b7267eb0352ccc542a2/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1782353718", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong